Sculptor Andrew DeVries will be at his gallery in Lenox[ for a] “Meet the Artist[”] event to[ share] his passion of casting his own sculptures and creating lively colorful pastels.[ Also enjoy a] video portraying[ a] day in his life, illustrating his bronze process and the lost wax method, playing at the gallery.
The Berkshire Community Land Trust has invited Sarah Waring[,] Executive Director of the Center for[ an] Agricultural Economy (CAE), and Matthew Derr[,] President of Sterling College and CAE board member, down from Hardwick VT to share their organizations[�]� visions. Ms. Waring will share her vision of farmers, entrepreneurs, citizens, government and educators working together to effectively build a vibrant local economy that respects the region[’]s unique landscape. Mr. Derr will speak about Sterling College and their commitment to preparing the next generation of farm/food/[ag]ricultural entrepreneurs. $10 or 10 Berk[Shares.]
